              {{/if}}

              {{!-- Display Section — now expandable. Previously held
                   a nested "Change Display" sub-dropdown that only
                   contained Classic View; flattened per request so the
                   single child action shows directly under Display
                   with the board-grid icon (matches My Boards) instead
